1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,540
给鸡蛋做护具，从 32 米高扔下去，不许碎。
Build a carrier so an egg survives a 32-metre drop.

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:12,480
这是 Anthropic 官方的演示，两队同时开工。
Anthropic's own demo. Two teams start at the same time.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,150
左边 Opus 5.5 单干，右边多带 10 个 Haiku 5.5。
Left: Opus 5.5 alone. Right: Opus 5.5 plus ten Haiku 5.5 subagents.

4
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:22,680
右边 58 秒到顶，试了 86 个设计，花 0.14 美元。
Right: 58 seconds, 86 designs, $0.14.

5
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:33,350
左边也成了：3 分 37 秒，25 个设计，0.47 美元。
Left made it too: 3:37, 25 designs, $0.47.

6
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,390
同一个目标，快了近四倍，便宜了七成。
Same goal: nearly four times faster and about 70% cheaper.

7
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:40,720
但这只是官方挑的一道题，别当通用结论。
But it is a single task Anthropic chose. Don't read it as a general result.

8
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:44,120
这期讲清楚两款新模型：价格，和能力。
This video covers two new models: price, and capability.

9
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,710
Sonnet 5.5 是九月底发布的。
Sonnet 5.5 shipped in late September.

10
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:49,760
Haiku 5.5 紧跟着，十月初发布。
Haiku 5.5 followed in early October.

11
00:00:49,910 --> 00:00:54,890
先看价格。官方推文：Haiku 5.5 平均便宜约 75%。
Price first. The official post says Haiku 5.5 costs about 75% less on average.

12
00:00:54,910 --> 00:00:57,650
对比的是上一代 Haiku 4.5。
The comparison is with the previous Haiku 4.5.

13
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:01,100
官方文档里，四款模型每百万 token 的价格：
The docs price four models per million tokens, input and output separately:

14
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:05,220
Fable 5.1：输入 10 美元，输出 50 美元。
Fable 5.1: $10 in, $50 out.

15
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:08,400
Opus 5.5：输入 4 美元，输出 20 美元。
Opus 5.5: $4 in, $20 out.

16
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:12,630
Sonnet 5.5：输入 2 美元，输出 10 美元。
Sonnet 5.5: $2 in, $10 out.

17
00:01:12,650 --> 00:01:16,500
Haiku 5.5：输入 0.1 美元，输出 0.5 美元。
Haiku 5.5: $0.10 in, $0.50 out.

18
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:20,180
Haiku 5.5 比 Sonnet 5.5，便宜整整 20 倍。
Haiku 5.5 is exactly 20 times cheaper than Sonnet 5.5.

19
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:23,950
同样跑 100 万输入、20 万输出 token，账是这样的：
Run 1M tokens in and 200K out, and the bill looks like this:

20
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:28,490
Haiku 5.5 要 0.2 美元，Sonnet 5.5 要 4 美元。
Haiku 5.5: $0.20. Sonnet 5.5: $4.

21
00:01:28,510 --> 00:01:32,090
Opus 5.5 要 8 美元，Fable 5.1 要 20 美元。
Opus 5.5: $8. Fable 5.1: $20.

22
00:01:32,110 --> 00:01:36,230
按官方标价算，没算折扣，提示都在 10 万以内。
At list price, no discounts, every prompt under 100K tokens.

23
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:40,140
再看 Sonnet 5.5：价格和 Sonnet 5 一样，没涨。
Now Sonnet 5.5. Same price as Sonnet 5. No increase.

24
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:43,230
Sonnet 5 原定九月涨价，官方取消了。
Sonnet 5 was due a September price rise. Anthropic cancelled it.

25
00:01:43,250 --> 00:01:46,380
官方说：同样的活，最多便宜 30%。
Anthropic says the same work costs up to 30% less.

26
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:49,890
单价没降，是它做同样的事，用的 token 更少。
The rate did not drop. It simply uses far fewer tokens.

27
00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:53,550
速度也快了：输出比 Sonnet 5 快 30% 以上。
It is faster too: output is 30% or more faster than Sonnet 5.

28
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:58,090
十月初还有一刀：Sonnet 5.5 的缓存读取减半。
Early October brought another cut: Sonnet 5.5 cache reads are half price.

29
00:01:58,110 --> 00:02:01,730
每百万 token，从 0.2 美元降到 0.1 美元。
From $0.20 to $0.10 per million tokens.

30
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:05,960
官方算，多数智能体任务因此再省约 20%。
Anthropic says most agentic tasks now cost about 20% less.

31
00:02:06,110 --> 00:02:09,480
回到 Haiku 5.5：价格按提示长度分两档。
Back to Haiku 5.5. Pricing has two tiers, set by prompt length.

32
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:13,630
提示 10 万 token 以内：输入 0.1，输出 0.5 美元。
Prompts up to 100K tokens: $0.10 in, $0.50 out.

33
00:02:13,650 --> 00:02:16,850
超过 10 万：输入 0.5，输出 2.5 美元。
Over 100K: $0.50 in, $2.50 out.

34
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:20,590
上一代 Haiku 4.5，是输入 1 美元，输出 5 美元。
The previous Haiku 4.5 charged $1 in, $5 out.

35
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:23,580
短提示降了九成，长提示降了五成。
Short prompts: 90% cheaper. Long prompts: 50% cheaper.

36
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:26,790
Haiku 4.5 九成的请求，都在 10 万以内。
Nine in ten Haiku 4.5 requests were under 100K tokens.

37
00:02:26,810 --> 00:02:29,280
综合下来，平均便宜约 75%。
Averaged out, about 75% cheaper.

38
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:32,470
这个数已经算进了新分词器多用的 token。
That figure already counts the extra tokens from the new tokenizer.

39
00:02:32,490 --> 00:02:35,440
官方只给了结论，没写完整算式。
Anthropic gives the result, not the full calculation.

40
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:38,170
订阅用户还有一笔每月 API 额度。
Subscribers also get a monthly API credit.

41
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:42,720
Max 5 倍档 100 美元，Max 20 倍档 200 美元。
Max 5x: $100. Max 20x: $200.

42
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:45,490
Team 最多 500 美元，全团队共用。
Team: up to $500, pooled across the team.

43
00:02:45,510 --> 00:02:49,060
能用在任何模型上，到账时间官方没写。
It works on any model. Anthropic does not give the exact timing.

44
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:51,440
再看能力。先看 Sonnet 5.5。
Now capability. Sonnet 5.5 first.

45
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:55,760
终端编程 Terminal-Bench 4.0：70.6%。
Terminal-Bench 4.0, terminal coding: 70.6%.

46
00:02:55,780 --> 00:03:00,410
Sonnet 5 只有 10.3%，Opus 5.5 是 66.4%。
Sonnet 5 scored 10.3%. Opus 5.5 scored 66.4%.

47
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:03,380
Opus 这个分数，取的是它最高的 Xhigh 档。
Opus's score is its best one, at Xhigh effort.

48
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:09,550
知识工作 GDPval-AA：1844 对 1846，只差 2 分。
GDPval-AA, knowledge work: 1844 against 1846. Two points apart.

49
00:03:09,570 --> 00:03:15,500
电脑操作 OSWorld 2.1：80.1% 对 81.8%。
OSWorld 2.1, computer use: 80.1% against 81.8%.

50
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:21,190
看图表 Chartography：61.6%，Sonnet 5 是 15.6%。
Chartography, reading charts: 61.6%, up from 15.6% on Sonnet 5.

51
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:25,620
它还是第一个只看截图通关《宝可梦 红》的 Sonnet。
It is also the first Sonnet to beat Pokémon Red from screenshots alone.

52
00:03:25,770 --> 00:03:29,780
八项里，Opus 5.5 领先七项，差距多在两三分。
Opus 5.5 leads on seven of eight, mostly by two or three points.

53
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:34,170
官方自己说：要持续判断的开放任务，Opus 5.5 更强。
Anthropic says Opus 5.5 is clearly stronger on open-ended work needing sustained judgment.

54
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:37,040
这些成绩，都是 Anthropic 自己公布的。
All of these scores are published by Anthropic itself.

55
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:41,230
再看 Haiku 5.5。官方定位：大批量、省钱的活。
Now Haiku 5.5. Anthropic positions it for high-volume, cost-sensitive work.

56
00:03:41,250 --> 00:03:45,140
摘要、压缩、查数据库、分类，这类重复的活。
Summaries, compaction, database queries and classification.

57
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:48,580
也适合给 Opus、Sonnet 当编码子智能体。
It also pairs with Opus or Sonnet as a coding subagent.

58
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:51,970
因为够快，实时客服和浏览器操作也行。
It is fast enough for live customer support and browser use.

59
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:57,220
知识工作 GDPval-AA：1620，上一代只有 735。
GDPval-AA: 1620, up from 735 on Haiku 4.5.

60
00:03:57,240 --> 00:04:03,380
电脑操作 OSWorld 离线子集：72.4%，上一代 15.7%。
OSWorld offline subset: 72.4%, up from 15.7%.

61
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:08,350
终端编程 Terminal-Bench：39.2%，上一代是 0。
Terminal-Bench: 39.2%, up from 0.0%.

62
00:04:08,370 --> 00:04:12,280
官方表里，GPT-6 Luna 有成绩的六项，它全部领先。
In Anthropic's table, GPT-6 Luna has six scores. Haiku 5.5 leads on all six.

63
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:18,910
但终端编程比 Sonnet 5.5 差 31 个点：39.2% 对 70.6%。
But on Terminal-Bench it trails Sonnet 5.5 by 31 points: 39.2% against 70.6%.

64
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:23,460
官方也说：复杂的编码智能体任务，选 Sonnet 或 Opus。
Anthropic says Sonnet and Opus remain the better choice for complex agentic coding.

65
00:04:23,610 --> 00:04:26,420
它是第一个能调思考力度的 Haiku。
It is the first Haiku with adjustable effort levels.

66
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:29,560
官方还按思考力度，画了成绩对成本图。
Anthropic also plots score against cost at every effort level.

67
00:04:29,580 --> 00:04:33,120
三张图里，最高分那一端，都是 Sonnet 5.5。
In all three charts, the top score belongs to Sonnet 5.5.

68
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:37,830
官方推文说，Haiku 5.5 已经能在 Claude Code 里用了。
The official post says Haiku 5.5 is already available in Claude Code.

69
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:41,370
开头的护蛋演示，就是它当子智能体的样子。
The egg-drop demo at the start shows it working as a subagent.

70
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:46,070
怎么选？先看官方文档怎么写。
How to choose? Start with what the docs say.

71
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:48,930
拿不准，文档建议先用 Opus 5.5。
If you are unsure, the docs suggest starting with Opus 5.5.

72
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:50,960
要更快更省：Sonnet 5.5，
For speed and savings: Sonnet 5.5,

73
00:04:50,980 --> 00:04:54,010
官方叫它“速度和智能的最佳组合”。
'the best combination of speed and intelligence'.

74
00:04:54,030 --> 00:04:57,570
大批量、简单、要快的活，交给 Haiku 5.5。
High-volume, simple, latency-sensitive work goes to Haiku 5.5.

75
00:04:57,590 --> 00:05:02,040
四款上下文都是 100 万 token，Haiku 超 10 万按高档价。
All four take 1M tokens of context, but Haiku bills the higher tier above 100K.

76
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:05,250
先算一次任务多少钱，再看它做不做得成。
Work out what one task costs, then check whether it gets done.

77
00:05:05,270 --> 00:05:07,560
做不成的活，再便宜也是贵的。
A task that fails is expensive, however cheap the model.
